---
import CTAButton from './CTAButton.astro';
---
<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container teaser-grid">
    <div>
      <h3>Our space</h3>
      <p>
        Charnwood Intimacy is based in the same warm, private space as Charnwood Counselling: the
        second floor of The Old Arts College in the heart of Loughborough, above Public and
        Plants. The room is fully accessible, and there's excellent coffee nearby if you'd like
        time to reflect after your session. Sessions are also available online for clients
        anywhere in the UK, which some people find helps them feel more able to open up.
      </p>
      <CTAButton href="/our-space/" variant="link">More about our space &rarr;</CTAButton>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Pricing and how to book</h3>
      <p>
        Sessions last 50 minutes. As Jo is currently completing her specialist training,
        introductory session rates apply during this period, in person in Loughborough or online.
        Booking is simple: let us know when you're available and we'll find a time that works
        for us both. Or get in touch to talk it through first if you're not sure where to start.
      </p>
      <CTAButton href="/pricing-and-booking/" variant="link">Pricing &amp; booking &rarr;</CTAButton>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .teaser-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .teaser-grid p {
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .teaser-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
